flowchart TD
    Proposal[Public API proposal]
    Rust[Rust shape]
    CABI[C ABI shape]
    Bindings[All host-language shapes]
    ABIImpact{ABI/schema impact?}
    ADR[ADR required]
    Fixture[Conformance fixture]
    Review[API governance review]
    Accept[Accepted]
    Reject[Reject/rework]

    Proposal --> Rust --> CABI --> Bindings --> ABIImpact
    ABIImpact -- yes --> ADR --> Fixture
    ABIImpact -- no --> Fixture
    Fixture --> Review
    Review -- pass --> Accept
    Review -- fail --> Reject
